<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/20/eng@/~cl_2__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The issue is authorised of a sum not exceeding six hundred and ninety-seven million four hundred and one thousand and three hundred and twenty ringgit (RM697,401,320) from the Consolidated Fund for expenditure on the services specified in the Schedule for the service of the year 1996, not provided for or not fully provided for by the Supply Act 1996."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1996/20/eng@> .
